om/datalad/datalad/blob/cce8cf50996d298419c2dfd28c7efe63851d0e08/datalad/interface/run_procedure.py#L172-L173\n\nSo this works:\n\n    datalad --proc-post setup_yoda_dataset --cmd create -d yodads\n\nPerhaps this is just a documentation issue then?","files":null},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1533323577,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDE3NzA2NjI3MjM="},"added":["question"],"removed":[]},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1533323590,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDE3NzA2NjMwNTU="},"added":["FAQ"],"removed":[]},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1533323702,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQxMDM1MDAzNw==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2732#issuecomment-410350037"},"message":"AWESOME! thank you @kyleam .  Indeed might be worth documenting somewhere.  \nWe do have https://github.com/datalad/faq/ but I think that disconnect, since we can't just move issues between is not working. So I will move those questions from there here and we then could tag with new FAQ label the ones we consider worth it.  I think this one is a good one ;)","files":null},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1533323711,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MTc3MDY2NjI0MQ=="},"status":2}]}